---
import { APP_URL } from "../site";
import LobCycler from "./islands/LobCycler";
---
<section class="relative overflow-hidden px-4 pt-24 md:px-6 md:pt-32"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-[820px] flex-col items-center text-center"><h2 class="h-display reveal-blur">Coloque os lobs do seu lado</h2><p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-[26px] text-muted md:text-[18px] md:leading-[28px]">Uma turma que nunca deixa seu cliente sem resposta e sempre fala a favor da sua empresa.</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-col items-center gap-3 sm:flex-row"><a href={APP_URL} class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full whitespace-nowrap h-[52px] px-7 text-[17px] btn-glossy ">Começar agora</a><a href={APP_URL} class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full whitespace-nowrap h-[52px] px-7 text-[17px] bg-surface-2 text-ink transition-[background-color,transform] duration-200 hover:bg-[#dcebfb] active:scale-[0.98] ">Entrar</a></div></div><div class="relative mt-6 h-[330px] md:mt-8 md:h-[580px]" aria-hidden="true"><LobCycler client:visible={{ rootMargin: `400px` }} uid="cta" outline strokeWidth={0.5} reach={700} interval={3000} class="absolute top-2 left-1/2 w-[420px] -translate-x-1/2 md:top-3 md:w-[760px]" /></div></section>
